### run auth.http first to get oauthToken

### subscribe with bearer (API/service clients)
GET {{host}}/update/user
Authorization: Bearer {{oauthToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### browser-style: mint a one-time SSE ticket (POST = CSRF-safe mint, ADR-0002)
POST {{host}}/sse-ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{oauthToken}}

> {%
    client.global.set("sseTicket", response.body.ticket)
%}

### subscribe with the ticket — single-use: re-mint before every (re)connect
GET {{host}}/update/user?ticket={{sseTicket}}
Accept: text/event-stream
